<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Brew a drink... for a very particular... refined coffee drinker.-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.description>为一个非常特别的……精制咖啡饮用者冲泡一杯饮料。</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing cannibal coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.jobString>酿造食人咖啡。</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew cannibal coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.label>煮食人咖啡</VBE_BrewCannibalCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a drink made with whiskey and coffee blended thoroughly before forming a head and being topped with a spoonful of whipped cream. Perfect for those who just got out of bed and are already wanting to go back to it.-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.description>酿造一杯由威士忌和咖啡充分混合而成的饮料，然后形成泡沫，并在上面淋上一勺生奶油。非常适合那些刚刚起床并已经想回去睡觉的人。</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing irish coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.jobString>冲泡爱尔兰咖啡。</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew irish coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.label>冲泡爱尔兰咖啡</VBE_BrewIrishCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a potent espresso mixed with fresh milk to help ease bitterness before pouring and serving. Lattes have a reputation of being particularly meant for “sophisticated” individuals.-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.description>在倒出和饮用之前，先冲泡一杯与新鲜牛奶混合的浓咖啡，以帮助减轻苦味。拿铁咖啡被誉为特别适合“成熟”的人。</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing latte coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.jobString>冲泡拿铁咖啡。</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew latte coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.label>冲泡拿铁咖啡</VBE_BrewLatteCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Brew a coffee mixed with sweet and luxurious chocolate. Those of snobbish persuasion would argue mocha is more of a dessert than an actual coffee drink.-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.description>冲泡一杯与香甜奢华的巧克力混合的咖啡。那些势利的人会认为摩卡更像是一种甜点，而不是真正的咖啡饮料。</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing mocha coffee.-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.jobString>冲泡摩卡咖啡。</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew mocha coffee-->
  <VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.label>冲泡摩卡咖啡</VBE_BrewMochaCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Make a particularly bitter tea cut with creamy milk, wakes one up a bit and relaxes one's mind.-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.description>用奶油牛奶泡一杯特别苦的茶，能让人清醒一点，放松心情。</VBE_MakeBlackTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making black tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.jobString>泡红茶。</VBE_MakeBlackTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make black tea-->
  <VBE_MakeBlackTea.label>泡红茶</VBE_MakeBlackTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make a warm, bitter beverage usually complemented with milk and sugar. A favorite among students and office workers across the galaxy due to high caffeine content and pleasing aroma. Brewing coffee in a espresso machine is generally much faster.-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.description>制作一种温热的苦味饮料，通常添加牛奶和糖。由于咖啡因含量高且香气宜人，深受整个银河系学生和上班族的喜爱。在浓缩咖啡机中冲泡咖啡通常要快得多。</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.description>
  <!--EN: Making coffee.-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.jobString>煮咖啡。</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.jobString>
  <!--EN: make espresso coffee-->
  <VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.label>制作浓缩咖啡</VBE_MakeCoffeeFast.label>
  <!--EN: Make a sugary tea left out to ferment, after fermenting the end product is a sweet and sour, sometimes even naturally fizzy drink known as kombucha. Praised for health benefits, though some remain skeptical.-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.description>制作一种留下发酵的含糖茶，发酵后的最终产品是一种酸甜的，有时甚至是自然碳酸饮料，称为康普茶。因其对健康的益处而受到赞扬，但有些人仍持怀疑态度。</VBE_MakeKombucha.description>
  <!--EN: Making kombucha tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.jobString>制作康普茶。</VBE_MakeKombucha.jobString>
  <!--EN: make kombucha tea-->
  <VBE_MakeKombucha.label>制作康普茶</VBE_MakeKombucha.label>
  <!--EN: Make a pleasing, aromatic beverage prepared by steeping a bag of tea leaves in boiling water. Brewing tea in this specially prepared espresso machine is generally much faster.-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.description>将一袋茶叶浸泡在沸水中，制成令人愉悦的芳香饮料。在这种专门准备的浓缩咖啡机中泡茶通常要快得多。</VBE_MakeTeaFast.description>
  <!--EN: Making fast tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.jobString>快速泡茶。</VBE_MakeTeaFast.jobString>
  <!--EN: make fast tea-->
  <VBE_MakeTeaFast.label>泡快茶</VBE_MakeTeaFast.label>
  <!--EN: Make a mixture of coffee and tea. Tea and coffee drinkers respectively set their differences aside while concocting this unholy amalgamation. Whether it’s served hot or cold it’s equally confusing to the imbiber.-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.description>制作咖啡和茶的混合物。喝茶和喝咖啡的人在调制这种邪恶的混合物时分别搁置了他们的差异。无论是热还是冷饮，都会让饮用者感到困惑。</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.description>
  <!--EN: Making yuenyeung.-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.jobString>制作元阳。</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.jobString>
  <!--EN: make yuenyeung-->
  <VBE_MakeYuenYeung.label>使元阳</VBE_MakeYuenYeung.label>
  <!--EN: This espresso machine has a small built-in grill to reheat iced coffee.-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.description>这款浓缩咖啡机有一个小型内置烤架，可以重新加热冰咖啡。</VBE_ReheatCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Reheating iced coffee.-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.jobString>重新加热冰咖啡。</VBE_ReheatCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: reheat iced coffee-->
  <VBE_ReheatCoffee.label>重新加热冰咖啡</VBE_ReheatCoffee.label>
</LanguageData>
